{
  "app_id": 4391380,
  "detailed_descriptions": {
    "en": "Artillery miner is an incremental game where you mine large blocks using artillery to gain ores and progress through a massive upgrade tree unlocking new worlds, ores and weapons. Choose from over 10 different worlds to mine in, 33 different weapons to mine with, and 20 new ores to discover. Process your ores into bars in furnaces, which can be upgraded. Use your bars to craft different materials in the crafting section. Use bars and crafted materials in an upgrades tree with 400+ unique upgrades, to upgrade your artillery and economy. Maxing out a world and destroying it completely will grant you a prestige cube which can be assigned to auto miners for idle collection and boosting ore dropped. Content: 10+ hours of content 33 different artilleries 10 different worlds 20 different ores 16 materials to craft 400+ unique upgrades Chill soundtrack made by marcomly Capsule Image by Rodrigo Talvarez"
  },
